OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fplenty of clear spells to end the day
OL,7,Fwith light winds. This will allow fog
OL,8,Fto redevelop overnight, the fog
OL,9,Flocally dense in prone spots. A chilly
OL,10,Fnight with areas of rural frost
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FFog and frost should gradually
OL,14,Fclear again on Monday morning with
OL,15,Fsome sunshine breaking through into
OL,16,Fthe afternoon. An easterly breeze
OL,17,Fdeveloping as the day unfolds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
