OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FCloudier with rain arriving from the
OL,7,Fsouth on Tuesday, accompanied by a
OL,8,Fbrisk southeasterly breeze. Further
OL,9,Frain on Wednesday, then brighter, but
OL,10,Ffeeling colder on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
